                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "■  Implication.  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#1F4E79"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "A revenue model that takes a percentage of each payment's value (MDR) earns little on these payments. Merchant software, credit on UPI and lending are better bets.",
